  "description": "Reid eTrike 500W 720Wh Electric Tricycle\nA powerful and practical electric tricycle designed for comfortable journeys and everyday carrying. The Reid eTrike combines a 500W motor, high-capacity 720Wh battery and stable three-wheel design to make errands, commuting and transporting heavier loads easier.\nPowered by a 48V 500W motor and a 48V 15Ah (720Wh) battery, the eTrike provides electric assistance for tackling hills, headwinds and longer journeys, with an advertised range of up to 70 miles (112km). Adjustable assistance levels are controlled through the Key Display KD58C.\nComfort is built into the design, with a low-step folding alloy frame, supportive saddle with integrated back support and ergonomic handlebars. The three-wheel configuration provides a stable platform, while the upright riding position supports a relaxed riding experience.\nPractical carrying space makes the eTrike suitable for shopping, everyday errands and transporting equipment. It features a front basket with a maximum load capacity of 12kg and a rear basket rated to carry up to 50kg, with a maximum total payload of 210kg.\nA Shimano 6-speed drivetrain gives riders flexibility across different routes, while Star Union hydraulic disc brakes with 160mm rotors provide controlled braking. Wide 20 x 3.0\" urban tyres, front and rear mudguards and integrated LED lights complete this practical electric tricycle.\nCombining generous battery capacity, comfortable features and useful cargo space, the Reid eTrike 500W 720Wh is designed to make everyday journeys more convenient.\nThe Reid eTrike is ideal for:\n\nLonger journeys, with a 720Wh battery and advertised range of up to 70 miles (112km)\nEveryday shopping and errands, with front and rear carrying baskets\nTransporting heavier items, with a rear basket rated to 50kg\nComfortable riding, with a supportive saddle and integrated back support\nPractical storage, with a folding step-through frame\nConfident stopping, with Star Union hydraulic disc brakes\n\nMaximum front basket load: 12kg. Maximum rear basket load: 50kg. Maximum total payload: 210kg. Actual range depends on terrain, rider weight, assistance level and riding conditions.",
